      "value": "<p>The M-13 Raptor is a semi-automatic sniper rifle built around a combat scope rather than a long-range optic, trading the punch of heavier rifles for a light frame and a fast follow-up. Cerberus issued it to augmented operatives who needed to shoot at range and still move like infantry; the ten-round heat sink lets a shooter stay on target through a whole engagement.</p>"
